":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I7M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"729eef57-5d98-42fe-b6c7-4163b19b7c19","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```var i I = f```\nインターフェイスを必ず使うという前提で考えてました","ts":"1617336304.354600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W=="}]},{"client_msg_id":"98d00566-1ace-47c8-8a8c-36df08b4427e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なーんか整理ついていないなと思ったら\nアサーションや代入のときにエラーになるから、それで検出できるので問題ないんじゃ？と思っていました","ts":"1617336231.353300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O+KX4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efd27b7d-473b-46bd-8c69-863803bfd3df","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"宣言時点では確かにエラーにならないスネ","ts":"1617336196.352600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ri=V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"807c2f32-108f-46de-b809-51ca9dd3eb4c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あ","ts":"1617336127.352200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EAI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acbef145-57f5-45fd-bc9c-7517a213749b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ","ts":"1617336047.352100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gaJAD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48739890-5d42-43f2-b41a-103751910fc2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ライブラリとして提供する型は usage が別の人なので、ライブラリ開発者が API うっかり壊してしまうことがあり得る、のでそれを防止したい、って話では","ts":"1617336019.351900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OU/s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9088ccd-4690-41fb-a056-331270150a09","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"例えば `doSomething` に勝手に引数足したりした場合\n```var _ I = (*foo)(nil)```\nの行が無いとエラーにならないですよね。","ts":"1617335870.351800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bTPg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88035352-a5de-4ac8-b009-f0c0d631b394","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"分からないですよね。明示的に指定してないと。","ts":"1617335866.351600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wpJbF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64937afc-a94e-4fdb-8791-bc88b205fd9d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://mattn.kaoriya.net/software/lang/go/20190702104455.htm\u003e\nインターフェイスを実装しているかどうかはコンパイル時にわかるので、これやり方のメリットが良くわからないんですが、\nそもそもそういう話ではないしょうか？","ts":"1617335706.350400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Big Sky: Big Sky :: Go で型がインタフェースを実装している事を保証するには","id":1,"title":"Big Sky :: Go で型がインタフェースを実装している事を保証するには","title_link":"https://mattn.kaoriya.net/software/lang/go/20190702104455.htm","text":"システム開発屋がひっそり語るぼやき","thumb_url":"https://mattn.kaoriya.net/images/logo.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Big Sky","service_icon":"https://mattn.kaoriya.net/favicon.ico","thumb_width":113,"thumb_height":113,"from_url":"https://mattn.kaoriya.net/software/lang/go/20190702104455.htm","original_url":"https://mattn.kaoriya.net/software/lang/go/20190702104455.htm"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"regL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83c65adf-4199-4574-a4fd-c682d1f33bb9","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"よりよい案だとは思うけどまた風呂敷広がったなあ〜","ts":"1617330471.349100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jr7Lk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fc23ed2-7f05-4d16-a7ef-36f4030d658f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"でも将来的にtype constraint以外にも使うつもりならそれ前提でいろいろ練っておかないといけなさそう\ngenerics導入伸びそうまである","ts":"1617329429.348700","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1617329436.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aXu"}]},{"client_m